# SentinelGrid Healthcare Platform — Frontend Environment Configuration
# Target: Vercel (Production) / Vite Dev Server (Local)

# In local development, leave this empty to use Vite's built-in dev proxy (/api -> localhost:8080).
# In production on Vercel, set this to your deployed Render backend URL:
# Example: https://sentinelgrid-backend.onrender.com (or https://sentinelgrid-backend.onrender.com/api)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
